class=\"free-gift-card-badge\" style=\"background-color: #006E37; color: #FFFFFF;\">Free Gift</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"jc-card__body\"><div class=\"loox-rating\" data-id=\"7935965265999\" data-rating=\"4.3\" data-raters=\"113\"></div>\n\n      \n<div class=\"price jc-card__price price--on-sale\">\n    <div class=\"price__container\"><div class=\"price__regular\"><span class=\"visually-hidden visually-hidden--inline\">Regular price</span>\n          <span class=\"price-item price-item--regular\">\n            $118.92\n          </span></div>\n      <div class=\"price__sale\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden visually-hidden--inline\">Regular price</span>\n          <span>\n            <s class=\"price-item price-item--regular\">\n              \n                $139.90\n              \n            </s>\n          </span><span class=\"visually-hidden visually-hidden--inline\">Sale price</span>\n        <span class=\"price-item price-item--sale price-item--last\">\n          $118.92\n        </span>\n      </div></div></div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"jc-card__title\" id=\"title-template--19982205124687__product-grid-7935965265999\">\n        <a href=\"/products/test-complete-care-bundle\" id=\"CardLink-template--19982205124687__product-grid-7935965265999\" class=\"jc-card__link\">Anti-Aging Glow-Up Bundle</a>\n      </h3><div class=\"jc-card__description\">\n          <div class=\"metafield-rich_text_field\"><p>The perfect duo for brighter, smoother, deeply rejuvenated skin — buy both and save $26.</p></div>\n        </div></div>\n  </div>\n    </li></ul></div>\n</div></div></div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n</div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--19982205124687__about_us_faq_qGN6mM\" class=\"shopify-section\"><noscript></noscript>\n<div class=\"bg-creme about-us-faq\" id=\"section-template--19982205124687__about_us_faq_qGN6mM\">\n  <div class=\"page-width\">\n    <div class=\"section_header\">\n      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section_inner faq-wrapper\"><div class=\"faq-columns\">\n\n        \n          <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n          <div class=\"faq-column faq-column--left\">\n            \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>Do you offer a Money Back Guarantee?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>Yes. Try JIYU risk-free for 90 days. If you're not in love with your results, we'll refund you 100% — even if you've opened and used the product. Just email<a href=\"mailto:support@jiyuskin.com\" target=\"_blank\">support@jiyuskin.com</a>with your order number.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>How soon will I see results?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>Most customers notice a healthier glow and smoother texture within 1–2 weeks. Dark spots, fine lines, and tone keep improving with consistent use over 4–8 weeks. Skin renews on its own cycle — give any new routine a full 4 weeks before you judge it.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>Are JIYU products suitable for sensitive skin?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>Yes. Our formulas are built to be gentle, with soothing actives like Centella Asiatica and Madecassoside, and they're free from parabens, sulfates, phthalates, and drying alcohols. If your skin is reactive, patch test first and start once daily, then build up as your skin adjusts.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>Are JIYU products cruelty-free and vegan?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>We are cruelty-free — always. Some formulas contain snail mucin, so not every product is vegan. The full ingredient list on each product page will tell you which.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>How do I know I'm buying authentic JIYU?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>JIYU is sold<strong>only</strong>through jiyuskin.com, Amazon (sold by JIYU Skincare), and TikTok Shop (@jiyuskin). Any other website, marketplace seller, or social store claiming to sell JIYU is unauthorized and not affiliated with us — and we can't guarantee what's in the bottle or honor the guarantee on it.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n          </div>\n\n          <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n          <div class=\"faq-column faq-column--right\">\n            \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>Which JIYU product should I start with?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>It depends on what you want to change first.</p><ul><li><strong>Dullness, dark spots, uneven tone</strong> — start with the <strong>Renewal &amp; Rejuvenation Toner Pads</strong>.</li><li><strong>Fine lines, dryness, loss of firmness</strong> — start with the <strong>NAD+ Anti-Aging Moisturizing Cream</strong>.</li><li><strong>You want the full routine</strong> — a <strong>bundle</strong> is the most complete (and best value) way in.</li></ul>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>Can I use JIYU products together?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>Yes — they're formulated as a system, not competing single products. The routine order is:</p><p><strong>Cleanse → Toner Pads → Serum → Moisturizer → SPF (AM)</strong></p><p>Every formula is designed to layer without pilling or over-exfoliating.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>What makes JIYU different from other K-beauty brands?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>Most K-beauty is built around hydration and barrier support — and does it beautifully. JIYU goes further. We pair Korean formulation precision with<strong>longevity-based ingredients</strong>drawn from longevity medicine — the science of what keeps cells healthy and resilient over time. The goal isn't just skin that looks better today; it's skin that functions better long-term.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                  <div class=\"faq-question\">\n                    <p>Where are JIYU products made?</p>\n                    <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" viewbox=\"0 0 14 9\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M13.6338 0.296875C13.957 0.587725 13.9903 1.09432 13.707 1.42773L7.58301 8.62793C7.43534 8.80146 7.2226 8.90039 7 8.90039C6.80522 8.90035 6.61796 8.82451 6.47559 8.68945L6.41797 8.62793L0.292969 1.42773C0.00964013 1.09434 0.0427534 0.587745 0.366211 0.296875C0.687732 0.00783005 1.17606 0.040401 1.45801 0.37207L6.92383 6.79883L7 6.8877L7.07617 6.79883L12.542 0.373047C12.8239 0.0416589 13.3119 0.00808543 13.6338 0.296875Z\" fill=\"#006E37\" stroke=\"#006E37\" stroke-width=\"0.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"faq-answer\" style=\"max-height: 0px;\">\n                    <p></p><p>Every JIYU product is formulated and manufactured in South Korea, at partner facilities operating at the highest standard in the global skincare industry — full CGMP, ISO 9001, ISO 14001, and ISO 22716 cosmetics GMP certification. Our founding team visited these facilities in person before committing to them.</p>\n<p></p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              \n            \n              \n            \n          </div>\n        \n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- SHOW MORE LINK -->\n      \n        <a class=\"faq-show-more faq-show-btn\" href=\"/pages/faq-page\">\n          SHOW MORE\n        </a>\n      \n</div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div><section id=\"shopify-section-template--19982205386831__instafeed_homepage_v2\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n\n\n<div id=\"section-template--19982205386831__instafeed_homepage_v2\" class=\"bg-creme instafeed-section section-template--19982205386831__instafeed_homepage_v2-padding\">\n  <div class=\"page-width\">\n    <!-- Heading -->\n    <div class=\"video__heading\">\n      <div class=\"\">\n        \n          <h2 class=\"\">Follow Us on Social</h2>\n        \n\n        \n          <p class=\"\">Get skincare tips, behind-the-scenes, and firs